      "date": "2026-02-09T01:16:39.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹1.12 (vs ₹2.40 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹1.12 (down from ₹2.40 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹2.90b (up 7.2% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹97.8m (down 53% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.4% (down from 7.8% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 26% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 12% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
