      "date": "2026-02-07T10:30:00.000Z",
      "title": "Kuantum Papers Limited Announces Resignation of Bhavdeep Sardana as Independent Director and Reconstitution of Committees, Effective 07 February, 2026",
      "body": "Kuantum Papers Limited at its board meeting held on 07th February, 2026, the Board has also accepted and approved the resignation of Shri Bhavdeep Sardana, Independent Director of the Company, with effect from the closure of business hours on 07 February, 2026. Membership of Board Committees Nomination and Remuneration Committee; Stakeholders' Relationship Committee; Corporate Social Responsibility Committee; Securities Committee. The re-constituted committees are as follows:\nAudit Committee: The members include Mr. Vivek Bihani, who is an Independent Director and serves as the Chairman; Mr. Pavan Khaitan, who is an Executive Director and a Member; Ms. Shireen Sethi, who is an Independent Director and a Member; Mr. Munishwar Kumar, who is an Independent Director and a Member; and Mr. Jagde",
